[agent:result]     Query the specified vector index.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]     :param index_name: str
[agent:result]       Name of the vector index to query.
[agent:result]     :param columns: List[str]
[agent:result]       List of column names to include in the response.
[agent:result]     :param columns_to_rerank: List[str] (optional)
[agent:result]       Column names used to retrieve data to send to the reranker.
[agent:result]     :param facets: List[str] (optional)
[agent:result]       Facets to compute over the matched results. Each entry has one of these forms: `"<column>"` - top 10
[agent:result]       distinct values by count `"<column> TOP <n>"` - top n distinct values, where n > 0 `"<column>
[agent:result]       BUCKETS [[from,to],...]"` - inclusive numeric ranges `TOP` and `BUCKETS` are case-insensitive. A
[agent:result]       column may appear at most once.
[agent:result]     :param filters_json: str (optional)
[agent:result]       JSON string representing query filters.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]       Example filters:
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]       - `{"id <": 5}`: Filter for id less than 5. - `{"id >": 5}`: Filter for id greater than 5. - `{"id
[agent:result]       <=": 5}`: Filter for id less than equal to 5. - `{"id >=": 5}`: Filter for id greater than equal to
[agent:result]       5. - `{"id": 5}`: Filter for id equal to 5.
[agent:result]     :param num_results: int (optional)
[agent:result]       Number of results to return. Defaults to 10.
[agent:result]     :param query_columns: List[str] (optional)
[agent:result]       Text columns to search for `query_text`. When empty, all text columns are searched.
[agent:result]     :param query_text: str (optional)
[agent:result]       Query text. Required for Delta Sync Index using model endpoint.
[agent:result]     :param query_type: str (optional)
[agent:result]       The query type to use. Choices are `ANN` and `HYBRID` and `FULL_TEXT`. Defaults to `ANN`.
[agent:result]     :param query_vector: List[float] (optional)
[agent:result]       Query vector. Required for Direct Vector Access Index and Delta Sync Index using self-managed
[agent:result]       vectors.
[agent:result]     :param reranker: :class:`RerankerConfig` (optional)
[agent:result]       If set, the top 50 results are reranked with the Databricks Reranker model before returning the
[agent:result]       `num_results` results to the user. The setting `columns_to_rerank` selects which columns are used
[agent:result]       for reranking. For each datapoint, the columns selected are concatenated before being sent to the
[agent:result]       reranking model. See https://docs.databricks.com/aws/en/vector-search/query-vector-search#rerank for
[agent:result]       more information.
[agent:result]     :param score_threshold: float (optional)
[agent:result]       Threshold for the approximate nearest neighbor search. Defaults to 0.0.
